docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:249:| `macro_strategy_manifests` | `manifest_id` uuid PK, kind ('transmission'/'policy_response'/'cycle_table'/'review'/'explain_facts'), `body` jsonb（§4.5 整份清单）, `manifest_hash` text（hex64）, cutoff timestamptz, method_version, code_version, catalog_version, created_at | UNIQUE(manifest_hash)；anon/authenticated select；写仅经 `macro_put_manifest` |
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:250:| `macro_review_results` | `result_id` uuid PK, region, month, status ('ok'/'insufficient'), manifest_id, manifest_hash, facts jsonb, method_version, code_version, created_at | UNIQUE(region, month, manifest_hash)；anon/authenticated select；不可变 |
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:253:| `macro_explanation_runs` | `explanation_id` uuid PK（RPC 生成）, user_id, request_id uuid, payload_hash, subject_kind, subject_id, locale, manifest_id, state ('running'/'accepted'/'rejected'/'failed'/'abandoned'), claimed_at, finished_at, provider, model, prompt_version, validator_version, raw_output jsonb, validation jsonb, `usage_audit_key`（= `explanation_id::text`；计量 RPC 的幂等键类型是 uuid）, `accounting` jsonb, `finalize_payload` jsonb（`finalizeUsageRun` 的完整参数，含 `status`、定价版本、汇率、聚合计量；`macro_record_completion` 写入）, `finalized` boolean default false, `late_output` jsonb（abandoned 之后迟到的完成） | UNIQUE(user_id, request_id)；**service only** |
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:254:| `macro_explanations` | explanation_id PK, user_id, subject_kind, subject_id, locale, manifest_id, state, rendered jsonb（仅 accepted：`{facts:[{fact_id,text}], hypotheses:[{text,fact_ids}]}`）, failure_codes text[]（rejected / failed）, provider, model, prompt_version, validator_version, created_at, finished_at | RLS `user_id = auth.uid()` select 给 authenticated；写仅经 RPC |
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:258:- `macro_put_manifest(p_kind, p_body, p_manifest_hash, p_cutoff, p_method_version, p_code_version, p_catalog_version)`：同 `manifest_hash` 存在 → 返回已有 id；否则插入。`manifest_hash = sha256(canonicalJson(body))`，`body` 即 §4.5 的整份清单（含 kind、params、cutoff、全部冻结依赖与版本），服务端计算；集成测试断言同一 body 两次调用返回同一 id、body 任一字段不同则不同 id。
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:259:- `macro_publish_review(p_region, p_month, p_expected_generation, p_cutoff, p_status, p_manifest_id, p_manifest_hash, p_facts, p_method_version, p_code_version)`：对 `(region, month)` 事务级咨询锁 → 按 `(region, month, manifest_hash)` 取或插入结果行 → 读当前指针（不存在视为 `generation=0, cutoff=null, result_id=null`）：① 指针已指向该结果 → `outcome='replayed'`（不前移，无论期望代际）；② `generation <> p_expected_generation` → `outcome='stale'`；③ 当前 `cutoff` 非空且 `p_cutoff < cutoff` → `outcome='stale'`；④ 否则指针指向该结果、`generation+1`（首次发布得 1）、`cutoff = p_cutoff` → `outcome='advanced'`。每次调用都在同一事务内写一条尝试日志（`ok`/`replayed`/`stale`）；`stale` 是返回值，不抛异常。返回 `{result_id, generation, outcome}`。
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:262:- `macro_claim_explanation(p_user_id, p_request_id, p_payload_hash, p_subject_kind, p_subject_id, p_locale, p_manifest_id)`：对 `(user_id, request_id)` 加事务级咨询锁并锁定已有运行行；已存在：`payload_hash` 不同 → 抛 `payload_conflict`；`running`、`claimed_at` 早于 5 分钟且未登记完成（`raw_output` 不是 JSON 对象）→ 原子改 `abandoned`、投影 `failed`（`failure_codes=['abandoned']`），返回 `{outcome:'existing', …}`（已登记完成的行留给完成恢复，第 5 稿 R2-1）；其他 → `{outcome:'existing', explanation_id, usage_audit_key, projection}`；不存在 → 生成 `explanation_id`、`usage_audit_key = explanation_id::text`，插入 `running` 运行行与投影，返回 `{outcome:'claimed', explanation_id, usage_audit_key, projection}`。**只有 `claimed` 的调用方可以进入计费与模型调用。**
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:268:迁移共八个 RPC：`macro_put_manifest`、`macro_publish_review`、`macro_record_review_attempt`、`macro_claim_explanation`、`macro_record_completion`、`macro_finish_explanation`、`macro_mark_finalized`、`macro_expire_explanations`。
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:272:### 4.5 策略清单（`manifest.ts`，所有 P3 / P4 计算的唯一输入）
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:279: snapshots:{US:FrozenSnapshot|null;CN:FrozenSnapshot|null};          // 两区域在 cutoff 时的快照（冻结记录）
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:285: timeliness?:Array<{series_id:string;state:Timeliness}>;            // 仅复盘，按截止日计算后冻结
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:292:- **参数**：计算参数（传导的区域、矩阵的窗口 N、历史表的边界）冻结在 `params` 中并参与哈希；每个参数值是独立的清单身份；视图与重放只从 `params` 读取参数。
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:293:- **事件证据**：事件源历史不整体复制，但冻结推导与核验每个事件所需的观测——所有事件的证据观测与 2008 衔接三元组——角色 `events:<series>:evidence`（`source.kind='history'`）。
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:294:- **解读事实**：`explain_facts` 清单把交给模型的确切事实列表冻结在 `facts`；模型输入只凭清单重建。
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-macro-workbench-p3-p4-design.md:299:- **冻结**：计算前组装清单 → `manifest_hash = sha256(canonicalJson(body))`（唯一身份，§4.4）→ `macro_put_manifest`（幂等）→ 计算只读清单。响应带 `manifest_id`。
